<title>THAILAND: Quality Houses yr net rises 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Quality Houses yr net rises 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial results for year ending December 31 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  2.61     vs	   3.49</p>
<p>    Net			 334.73     vs	 319.99</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Quality Houses Plc, a housing developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-6520642</p>
